              "hideComponent": "false",
              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Sage Multi-Position MATS 2.0</span></span></span></h1>\n<h2>Mobile Air Transfer System</h2>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Tilt and transfer patients with confidence in the OR.</span></p>\n",
